- Only fires when `document.hidden` is false (tab is visible)
- Only fires when all three are present: `currentCourse`, `currentLo`, `tutorsId`
- Only fires when `analyticsEnabled` is true (a module-level flag that can be disabled)
- Only fires when not in `anonMode`

**Where `startTimer()` is called**: In the course-reader layout at `D:\code\tutors_repo\src\routes\(course-reader)\+layout.svelte`, line 12:

```typescript
tutorsConnectService.startTimer();
```

This means the timer starts once when the course-reader layout mounts and runs for the lifetime of that layout. The same layout also triggers `learningEvent(page.params)` inside a `$effect` that runs on every navigation within the course reader (line 16), which records page loads and sends presence events.

